Package: iptv-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, fzf, mpv, jq
Maintainer: Third Movement <dev@thirdmovement.net>
Homepage: https://github.com/iptv-org/iptv
Description: TUI launcher for iptv-org IPTV playlists
 iptv-cli browses iptv-org playlists with an fzf-based drill-down
 selector (country / category / language -> channel) and plays the
 selected stream in mpv. Playlists are fetched live from iptv-org, so
 the channel list stays current without any locally stored data.
